<title>UK: Commerzbank sets warrants on three German stocks.</title>
<headline>Commerzbank sets warrants on three German stocks.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commerzbank AG said it has issued American-style call and put warrants of 10 million per tranche on three German stocks.</p>
<p>The warrants are on shares of Deutsche Bank, Volkswagen and Dresdner Bank. The exercise period is February 12, 1997 until March 18, 1998 and the payment date is February 5, 1997. The warrants are all listed on the Frankfurt and Duesseldorf exchanges.</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
